{
 "annotations": {
  "openWorldHint": false,
  "readOnlyHint": true,
  "title": "Stock Holders"
 },
 "description": "Returns every available active cash-equity 13F holder position for one stock and one quarter, using cursor pagination.\n\nWHEN TO USE: The user asks who owns a stock, which institutions hold it, how large each disclosed position is, or wants all currently processed holders for a quarter.\n\nPARAMETERS:\n  - ticker_or_cusip: one ticker or exact CUSIP\n  - quarter: required YYYY-QN filing quarter\n  - cursor: pass the previous next_cursor to continue\n\nTicker input is expanded only when every matching CUSIP belongs to the same issuer prefix; ticker collisions require an exact CUSIP. The exact set used is returned in security.scoped_cusips, while security.resolved_cusip identifies the row supplying listing status/detail. Each holder row remains a distinct disclosed CUSIP position; different share classes are never silently merged. Exited positions are excluded.\n\nWHEN NOT TO USE:\n  - Use get_13f_activity for new, increased, decreased, or exited positions\n  - Use get_fund_holdings for one fund's full portfolio\n\nRETURNS: Resolved security identity and listing-status detail plus deterministically paginated holder positions with fund identity, shares, value, portfolio weight, change, conviction, nullable valuation/cost/P&L estimates, and page-scoped price coverage. No source-wide total is claimed.\n\nVERIFICATION: Cite record-level `source_url` filing or disclosure links when present.",
 "inputSchema": {
  "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "properties": {
   "cursor": {
    "maxLength": 500,
    "type": "string"
   },
   "limit": {
    "default": 5,
    "maximum": 100,
    "minimum": 1,
    "type": "integer"
   },
   "quarter": {
    "pattern": "^\\d{4}-Q[1-4]$",
    "type": "string"
   },
   "ticker_or_cusip": {
    "maxLength": 20,
    "minLength": 1,
    "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9./\\-]+$",
    "type": "string"
   }
  },
  "required": [
   "ticker_or_cusip",
   "quarter"
  ],
  "type": "object"
 },
 "name": "get_stock_holders",
